The Carrier panel on macOS 11. The Location map is CompatMarkerMap (MapKitCompat.swift), an MKMapView with the
reported position's pin, showing 1.5 km around the set location whenever that changes, where a click sets the
location: SwiftUI's Map, Marker, MapCameraPosition and MapReader are macOS 14. The MCC, MNC and message fields are
CompatTextFields (prompts are macOS 12): the prompt is the placeholder, and Return in the message sends it, as
onSubmit does. The message is one line, as macOS 11 has no vertical text field (axis: and lineLimit ranges are
macOS 13).

